<title>USA: Smithway Motor Xpress Q1 net up with revs.</title>
<headline>Smithway Motor Xpress Q1 net up with revs.</headline>
<dateline>FORT DODGE, Iowa 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smithway Motor Xpress Corp said Wednesday a focus on internal growth by improving operating efficiency helped earnings and revenues climb in the first quarter.</p>
<p>The truckload carrier services provider posted net income of $951,000, or $0.19 a share, compared to $513,000, or $0.15, a year ago.</p>
<p>Revenues increased to $26.9 million from $19.9 million in the first quarter of 1996, Smithway Motor said.</p>
<p>Smithway Motor shares were up 3/16 Wednesday at 8-11/16.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
